On available
    If player is karus
        Say "The was seems to be getting very unfavorable for us. Let's get it together and help Bros of [Order of the Sorcery]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "The was seems to be getting very unfavorable for us. Let's get it together and help Sais of [Order of the Sorcery]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "We have turned one corner but the war is still going unfavorable for us. Sigh..."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "We must seal rest of the devils without a moment's delay. However, you have to stay alert because your next target is [Devil 30] Forneus, who swallows his enemy with the features of a great sea monster. He's very strong and thus has been granted the title of Marquis. Additionally, please seal [Devil 54] Murmur and [Devil 69] Decarabia together.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [30Devil] Forneus, [54Devil] Murmur, and [69Devil] Decarabia."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "We have turned one corner but the war is still going unfavorable for us. Sigh..."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "We must seal rest of the devils without a moment's delay. However, you have to stay alert because your next target is [Devil 30] Forneus, who swallows his enemy with the features of a great sea monster. He's very strong and thus has been granted the title of Marquis. Additionally, please seal [Devil 54] Murmur and [Devil 69] Decarabia together.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [30Devil] Forneus, [54Devil] Murmur, and [69Devil] Decarabia."

On in_progress
    Say "You haven't sealed yet? Then I will send you again to them."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have sealed them up for sure. With this, we can seal three more devils."

On completed
    Say "One more devil to seal! It's the [6Devil] Duke Valefor, the god of thieves. Be careful, this man's got bad habit of stealing. Take the [6Devil Sommon Scroll] to [6Devil Summon Stone] in [Eslant]. Summon and eliminate him there."
